OL,3,GNEWSATeenagers suffer serious injuries
OL,4,Ain crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive teenagers have been taken to
OL,7,Fhospital with serious injuries after a
OL,8,Fcar crash in Derbyshire.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to the A5270 Old
OL,11,FCoalpit Lane, Chelmorton, at 02:10 GMT
OL,12,Fon Saturday.
OL,14,FDerbyshire Police said three girls and
OL,15,Ftwo boys travelling in a blue Suzuki
OL,16,FSwift were taken to hospital with
OL,17,Fserious injuries which are not believed
OL,18,Fto be life-threatening. All parents of
OL,19,Fthose involved have been contacted.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
