OL,3,GNEWSATeenagers suffer serious injuries
OL,4,Ain crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe road between the A515 to The Ditch
OL,7,Fis currently closed and will likely to
OL,8,Fremain shut for some time, the force
OL,9,Fadded.
